        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;:&quot;@startuml\nskinparam rectangle {\n  RoundCorner 10\n  FontSize 11\n  FontColor #1A2235\n}\nskinparam arrow {\n  Color #3A6BD4\n  FontColor #3A6BD4\n  FontSize 10\n}\nskinparam defaultFontName DM Sans\n&#39; Linetype ortho complex diagrams ko clean rakhta hai\nskinparam linetype ortho\n\ntitle High-Level Architecture — AI-Driven Smart LMS\n\n&#39; --- Layer 1: Client ---\nrectangle \&quot;**Client Layer**\&quot; as CL #EEF4FF {\n  rectangle \&quot;**Admin Portal**\&quot; as Admin #D6E4FF\n  rectangle \&quot;**Teacher Portal**\&quot; as Teacher #C8F0DC\n  rectangle \&quot;**Student Portal**\&quot; as Student #FFE0D0\n  \n  Admin -[hidden]right- Teacher\n  Teacher -[hidden]right- Student\n}\n\n&#39; --- Layer 2 &amp; 3 Combined for Width ---\nrectangle \&quot;Application Core\&quot; {\n  \n  rectangle \&quot;**API Gateway**\&quot; as AG #F5EEFF {\n    rectangle \&quot;**FastAPI REST API**\&quot; as API #EDE0FF\n    rectangle \&quot;**WebSocket Server**\&quot; as WS #EDE0FF\n    API -[hidden]right- WS\n  }\n\n  rectangle \&quot;**Business Logic Services**\&quot; as BL #EFFFEF {\n    rectangle \&quot;Auth &amp; User\&quot; as SAuth #C8F0DC\n    rectangle \&quot;Academic &amp; Enroll\&quot; as SAcad #C8F0DC\n    rectangle \&quot;Attendance &amp; Fee\&quot; as SAtt #C8F0DC\n    rectangle \&quot;Assessment &amp; Comm\&quot; as SAssess #C8F0DC\n    \n    SAuth -[hidden]right- SAcad\n    SAcad -[hidden]right- SAtt\n    SAtt -[hidden]right- SAssess\n  }\n}\n\n&#39; --- Layer 4: AI Layer (Horizontal Spread) ---\nrectangle \&quot;**AI Engine Layer**\&quot; as AIL #F5EEFF {\n  rectangle \&quot;Face Recognition\&quot; as FaceAI #EDE0FF\n  rectangle \&quot;AI Chatbot (RAG)\&quot; as ChatAI #EDE0FF\n  rectangle \&quot;Quiz &amp; Plag\&quot; as QuizAI #EDE0FF\n  rectangle \&quot;Analytics\&quot; as AnalyticsAI #EDE0FF\n  \n  FaceAI -[hidden]right- ChatAI\n  ChatAI -[hidden]right- QuizAI\n  QuizAI -[hidden]right- AnalyticsAI\n}\n\n&#39; --- Layer 5: Data &amp; External ---\nrectangle \&quot;Storage &amp; Intelligence\&quot; {\n  rectangle \&quot;**Data Layer**\&quot; as DL #FFFDE7 {\n    rectangle \&quot;MySQL DB\&quot; as DB #FFF9C4\n    rectangle \&quot;File Storage\&quot; as FS #FFF9C4\n    rectangle \&quot;FAISS Vector\&quot; as FAISS #FFF9C4\n    DB -[hidden]right- FS\n    FS -[hidden]right- FAISS\n  }\n\n  rectangle \&quot;**External**\&quot; as EXT #FFE8E8 {\n    rectangle \&quot;Gemini API\&quot; as GeminiExt #FFD0D0\n    rectangle \&quot;HuggingFace\&quot; as HF #FFD0D0\n  }\n}\n\n&#39; --- Connectivity ---\nCL -down-&gt; API : HTTP\nStudent -down-&gt; WS : WS\n\nAPI -down-&gt; BL\n\nSAuth -down-&gt; FaceAI\nSAtt -down-&gt; FaceAI\nSAssess -down-&gt; QuizAI\nSComm -down-&gt; ChatAI\nSAcad -down-&gt; AnalyticsAI\n\nBL -down-&gt; DL\n\nChatAI -right-&gt; GeminiExt\nQuizAI -right-&gt; GeminiExt\nFaceAI -[hidden]right- HF\n\n@enduml&quot;,&quot;format&quot;:&quot;svg&quot;}" id="14pVjtuajESJFR7WagT--21">
